# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree
# on all platforms. The windows-latest CI runner checks out with
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to CRLF and makes
# `ruff format --check` ([tool.ruff.format] line-ending = "lf") fail on
# files that are format-clean on Linux. Git's auto-detection leaves
# binaries (e.g. .omo/evidence/spike/flange.stl) untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
